x86_64-linux  the difference is COMDAT. cxx1 emits a function defined inside its class as an ordinary definition where clang emits it linkonce_odr in a COMDAT the collector does not read, so cxx1 lists members clang has and has hidden. This compiler has no weak or linkonce linkage, which is the root of every .nocl in this directory. What this case is about is checked by run.sh on all three machines.
